# Introduction to Teamwork (sandoria 63): Vilatroire in West Ronfaure. A WAR 10 at fame 49 (level 1): 134
# (replaceDefault, over his default 136); a trade while available: nothing (no trade handler, no script); fame 50 (level
# 2): 135 declined (nothing), 135 taken (begun); accepted, alone: the trigger returns nil (#party is 1), so his default
# 136; a trade: nothing. 129 (and its update and finish) starts only in a party of two or more: the #party flows take
# it. Vilatroire has no script; his default is 136. No other quest or mission names him besides the two later teamwork
# quests, which need this one completed.
lists WestRonfaure/Vilatroire/onTrigger WestRonfaure/onEventFinish/135 WestRonfaure/onEventUpdate/129 WestRonfaure/onEventFinish/129
char zone=WestRonfaure pos=-258.4,-71,423.4 job=WAR lvl=10
fame Sandoria 49
item BoneChip
login
trigger Vilatroire                        # fame level 1: 134 (replaceDefault)
finish
trade Vilatroire BoneChip x1              # available: no trade handler, no script: nothing
fame Sandoria 50
trigger Vilatroire                        # fame level 2, level 10: 135
finish                                    # option 0: nothing
trigger Vilatroire                        # 135
finish option=1                           # begun
trigger Vilatroire                        # accepted, alone (#party 1): nil; his default 136
finish
trade Vilatroire BoneChip x1              # accepted: no trade handler: nothing
